# One-time first boot of an RT-11 V5.3 *distribution* disk (rtv53_rl.dsk) so it boots
# straight to the RT11FB monitor afterwards. Run on a COPY of the image:
#   cp rtv53_rl.dsk rt11-work.dsk
#   simh_run.py --timeout 180 rt11-rl02.ini --steps rt11v53-firstboot.steps
# Answering NO to "automatic installation" makes AI copy the RT11FB bootstrap to the
# disk and reboot. The auto-install path (YES) wants backup media - don't use it here.
timeout 120
expect Press the "RETURN" key when ready
line
expect press the "RETURN" key\):
line NO
expect Press the "RETURN" key when ready
line
expect ^\.$
line SHOW
expect ^\.$
